4B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vvhVVOfk85cQ7kNvwHAGgup&_nc_oc=Adr1SCFeS0laQ6dNk6V5T_wjQGEWSeIjUzaS6jsmgq_hOvuyJGXWiWxFMACaVe_evyA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzHsb-F41VNq0cnY6nqYA4Wm-W5p1wmT2IrGWzeEPGITg&oe=69C131D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-1-MVwtEEYQ7kNvwFcbiJo&_nc_oc=AdoLy-vS6Exw6lw9calrIeHGzVLI57uqVhGuWo8kJUSjrgqsS93y8fiMuR7SmURhj2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxbz6AmpyN4RSWajeReFIW1aSG3MtryvmqNobwjJ1SlVA&oe=69C13715"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dx7sCANOCR8Q7kNvwFU-_Lm&_nc_oc=Adq6JbgxHHHTSz7-Xa56i4C4GqqvV5NCxvu7igDPgtw7kT19icwTqBbQgb2nfWHNLrY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx13tm5hy4lK_7A-er1ft9AaWslncTuHJfCLeu57_tlsQ&oe=69C14AC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JzGCURRFBSYQ7kNvwH44G7g&_nc_oc=AdpTDfYvy66ihYrVPWHJ_zECGyCuECSppwOeHcKcO_Yj0v658rcl2GPQQl9rH_7cIE8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyL8loHwF70rT9Sc7bAPUvWDRFUajM6NR0LItw0onFLXA&oe=69C13144"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ufSjDqV98M0Q7kNvwHjLKHw&_nc_oc=AdqdGrBgDO0PQMU1fitxA6zDB700Q9gKl2Olj45BLm5oW2y-wKijl6hLZIrsMMRPha8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyc91EcPiNBTtISW3oo5AB7dWa6VAYhayIM4HKj3Wr7cQ&oe=69C129A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 